{"seq":1,"slug":"two-sided-reward-qualification-model","title":"双边奖励与获客资格模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-program-model-incentive-design/two-sided-reward-qualification-model","wordCount":3022,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"双边奖励与获客资格模型\">双边奖励与获客资格模型</h1><p>PayPal 在 2000 年前后遇到的不是支付问题，而是获客问题：新用户注册后账上没有余额、也没有第二个能收付款的人，账户就是死的。他们给新注册用户和邀请人各打 10 美元，让「第一笔转账」有了对手方——这是双边奖励（two-sided reward）最早的规模化样本之一。跨境电商只是把同一道题换了个货币单位：用奖励去买一个能被邀请人亲手带进来的新用户时，<strong>你付的不只是钱，而是一套「谁算有效获客」的资格判定规则</strong>。规则松了，奖励流向刷单团伙；紧了，真实用户拿不到钱就走。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-双边奖励在优化什么\">核心概念：双边奖励在优化什么</h2><p>一个推荐计划的本质是一条<strong>把现有用户的社交关系当作获客渠道</strong>的流水线。它与广告投放最大的区别是：广告花钱买曝光，推荐花钱买<strong>已经完成某一步的用户</strong>——这一步由被邀请人自己做，不是你猜的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[邀请人获得推荐码] --&gt; B[分享到社群/私聊/短视频]&#10;  B --&gt; C[被邀请人点击落地页]&#10;  C --&gt; D{注册并绑定邀请关系}&#10;  D --&gt;|失败: 未注册| X[无奖励]&#10;  D --&gt;|成功| E{达成资格动作&lt;br/&gt;首单/付费/留存 N 天}&#10;  E --&gt;|未达成| Y[奖励挂起或作废]&#10;  E --&gt;|达成| F[双边奖励入账]&#10;  F --&gt; G[邀请人继续邀请]&#10;  F --&gt; H[被邀请人成为新邀请人]&#10;  G --&gt; B&#10;  H --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[邀请人获得推荐码] --&gt; B[分享到社群/私聊/短视频]\n  B --&gt; C[被邀请人点击落地页]\n  C --&gt; D{注册并绑定邀请关系}\n  D --&gt;|失败: 未注册| X[无奖励]\n  D --&gt;|成功| E{达成资格动作&lt;br/&gt;首单/付费/留存 N 天}\n  E --&gt;|未达成| Y[奖励挂起或作废]\n  E --&gt;|达成| F[双边奖励入账]\n  F --&gt; G[邀请人继续邀请]\n  F --&gt; H[被邀请人成为新邀请人]\n  G --&gt; B\n  H --&gt; B</pre><p>图里出口箭头回到 <code>B</code> 是有意的：推荐计划真正想要的不是「一次转化」，而是<strong>让新用户也变成邀请人</strong>——优惠券的终点是订单，推荐计划的终点是下一轮推荐。承载这条链路的码与链接本身怎么生成，见 <a href=\"../referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/referral-code-link-generation-model\">推荐码与分享链接生成模型</a>。</p>\n<p>「双边」是最容易被简化、却最不能省的一环。单边奖励（只奖邀请人）会诱导大量「为了拿奖励而拉人」的行为，被邀请人注册后即流失，因为<strong>他没有理由留下</strong>；把奖励同时给被邀请人，等于在转化那一刻就替他承担了第一次体验的成本。真实产品怎么选：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>邀请人奖励</th>\n<th>被邀请人奖励</th>\n<th>双边性</th>\n<th>设计意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PayPal Refer a Friend</td>\n<td>现金（早期 10 美元）</td>\n<td>现金（10 美元）</td>\n<td>完全双边</td>\n<td>让新账户一开就有余额可动，激活首笔 P2P 转账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dropbox（2010）</td>\n<td>250MB 存储</td>\n<td>250MB 存储</td>\n<td>完全双边</td>\n<td>奖励即产品本身，双方都因此更需要它</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Airbnb（2014）</td>\n<td>旅行抵扣金（较高）</td>\n<td>首单抵扣（较低）</td>\n<td>非对称双边</td>\n<td>邀请人贡献更高，两侧付出按边际成本定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Temu / Shein 类邀请活动（2024—2026）</td>\n<td>现金或大额券</td>\n<td>新人券包</td>\n<td>非对称双边</td>\n<td>拉新期重奖邀请人，用券包控制被邀请人成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon Associates</td>\n<td>按销售额分佣</td>\n<td>无（面向内容方）</td>\n<td>单边</td>\n<td>联盟制，非熟人推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表里 Airbnb 的「非对称双边」值得单拎出来：双边不代表两边等额。<strong>付多少取决于哪一方的边际成本更高</strong>——邀请人是你已获取的用户，多付是纯成本；被邀请人若因奖励不足而流失，损失的是整条链路的未来价值。多数成熟计划最终都收窄成非对称：邀请人拿固定小额，被邀请人拿首单折扣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"奖励结构的四个旋钮\">奖励结构的四个旋钮</h2><p>把奖励设计拆开，其实只有四个可调旋钮。任何「双边奖励方案」都是这四个维度的组合，混乱的方案通常源于没意识到自己同时在动四个旋钮。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>对转化率的影响</th>\n<th>对成本/作弊的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>付给谁</td>\n<td>单边 / 双边 / 群组</td>\n<td>双边显著抬高被邀请人转化</td>\n<td>群组奖励抬高团伙作弊风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计价方式</td>\n<td>固定金额 / 订单百分比 / 阶梯</td>\n<td>固定金额转化判断最直接</td>\n<td>百分比随客单价放大成本，需上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发放时点</td>\n<td>即时 / 递延（首单后）/ 分期</td>\n<td>即时转化最高</td>\n<td>即时发放几乎必然被刷，递延更抗作弊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励形态</td>\n<td>现金 / 抵扣券 / 积分 / 权益</td>\n<td>现金感知最强</td>\n<td>券的成本可控、易设过期、可回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个旋钮里，<strong>发放时点与资格模型是同一件事的两面</strong>：「注册即发」的作弊成本近乎为零，批量注册机只要一个手机号就能套走奖励，因此今天几乎只出现在早期冲刺里。用期望成本看，单次获客的推荐成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>inviter</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>invitee</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CAC}_{\\text{ref}} = \\dfrac{(R_{\\text{inviter}} + R_{\\text{invitee}}) \\cdot p \\cdot q}{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inviter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">invitee</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是达成资格动作的比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 是被邀请人最终核销奖励的比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是被邀请人成为「有效获客」的比例。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 常被忽略：<strong>发出去没被核销的券，不该按面值计入成本</strong>——一张 30 天有效、核销率 55% 的券，真实成本是面值 × 核销率 × 被核销商品的毛利率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资格模型-谁算-一次有效获客\">资格模型：谁算「一次有效获客」</h2><p>资格模型（qualification model）回答的是：被邀请人做了什么，双边奖励才真正可发。这是整个推荐体系里<strong>风险与转化收益直接对撞的那条线</strong>——选得保守流失有机增长，选得宽松等于给作弊团伙发工资。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资格档位</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>漏斗留存</th>\n<th>作弊难度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>注册</td>\n<td>完成手机号/邮箱验证</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>仅早期冲刺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激活</td>\n<td>完成关键动作（绑卡、加购、收藏）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>平台内非交易类推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首单</td>\n<td>完成第一笔订单</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>主流电商默认档位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首单且过退货期</td>\n<td>订单签收且过退货窗口</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高客单、高退货率品类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>留存 N 天</td>\n<td>注册后第 N 天仍活跃</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>订阅制、高频复购</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首单 + 二次复购</td>\n<td>完成第二单</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>追求 LTV 的成熟计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个反复被验证的经验是：<strong>把资格动作从「注册」推到「首单」，作弊成本通常上升一个数量级</strong>，因为刷单要真实支付并承担商品流转，而批量注册只要一次短信接口调用。再推到「过退货期」又上一个台阶——这也是高客单价品类（3C、大家电、奢侈品跨境）倾向用「签收 + 退货期外」而非「下单」作为发奖条件的原因。</p>\n<p>资格模型要能回答三个边界问题，否则实现时一定会在客诉里爆炸：<strong>退款与撤单</strong>（资格动作挂在「订单完成 fulfilled」而非「订单创建 created」上，奖励以可回收的积分/券形态发放）；<strong>奖励有效期</strong>（两侧各有独立过期时间，常见 30—90 天）；<strong>多级关系</strong>（被邀请人再邀请第三人时，原始邀请人是否有二级收益——这条直接踩在「三级分销」的红线上）。</p>\n<p>在数值上，净价值要用增量口径而非名义口径：设被邀请人带来的增量毛利为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GM</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GM}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GM</span></span></span></span></span></span>、双边形成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，则只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GM</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>GM</mtext><mtext>paid</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>paid</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GM} - C &gt; \\text{GM}_{\\text{paid}} - \\text{CAC}_{\\text{paid}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时推荐才值得扩量。很多「看起来很成功」的活动一经增量测算就现原形：被邀请人里相当比例本来就会自然购买（有机用户），这部分奖励是<strong>纯粹的成本漏损（cannibalization）</strong>。严格的计划会设对照组（holdout）测真实增量，而不是拿活动期间的新客数当功劳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位经济-k-因子-病毒周期与投放替代\">单位经济：K 因子、病毒周期与投放替代</h2><p>推荐计划之所以被单列为一个工程学科，是因为它有一个广告没有的指标：<strong>自繁殖系数</strong>。设每个用户平均发出的有效邀请数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>、每条被接受的比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = i \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时增长进入指数区间；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 则推荐只是<strong>更便宜的获客渠道</strong>。真实电商里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 极少长期大于 1——能维持 0.2—0.6 就已可观。\n但只看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 会犯错，因为<strong>增长速度还取决于病毒周期（viral cycle time）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，即「一个用户从注册到成功带来下一个用户」的平均耗时。正确的放大倍数形式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{\\tau} = K^{1/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 以天计）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 天时稳定放大倍数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.5</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.906</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5^{1/7}\\approx 0.906</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.906</span></span></span></span></span>；把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 3 天则变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.5</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.794</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5^{1/3}\\approx 0.794</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.794</span></span></span></span></span>，放大效应反而更弱。反过来说，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 天的计划自繁殖能力强于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 天的计划——<strong>缩短从「受邀」到「发出自己第一条邀请」的时间，往往比抬高奖励面值更有效</strong>：新用户完成首单后要立刻、就地展示他的推荐码。</p>\n<p>把推荐接入整体增长模型时，它作为降低混合 CAC 的通道存在，健康阈值经验上参考 LTV/CAC ≥ 3 的通用原则（可追溯至 Bessemer 与 David Skok 的 SaaS 指标体系）。推荐渠道的 CAC 应显著低于付费渠道，否则它只是换了个名字的广告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规与平台边界-2026\">合规与平台边界（2026）</h2><p>放在跨境语境下，双边奖励踩四条线：<strong>广告披露、平台政策、分销层级、税务与数据</strong>。它们不改变奖励设计本身，而是决定设计在哪些市场能直接跑、在哪些必须改写。逐地区判定表见 <a href=\"program-rules-region-compliance-design\">计划规则与地区合规边界设计</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>代表规则</th>\n<th>对推荐设计的直接影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>广告披露</td>\n<td>美国 FTC《Endorsements Guides》(16 CFR Part 255) 及 2023 年虚假评论 Notice of Penalty Offenses</td>\n<td>邀请人若获得奖励，其推广内容必须披露「有偿」关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台政策</td>\n<td>Apple App Store 审核指南 3.2.2(viii)；Google Play「欺骗性行为」政策</td>\n<td>应用内推荐若涉及外部码/内容分发，可能被拒审</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分销层级</td>\n<td>中国《禁止传销条例》(2005)、《网络反不正当竞争暂行规定》(2024-09-01 施行)</td>\n<td>「拉人头计酬、层级超三级、无实际交易」的模式被禁止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者保护</td>\n<td>欧盟《不公平商业行为指令》2005/29/EC、《数字服务法》(EU) 2022/2065</td>\n<td>奖励规则、有效期、适用限制须在购买前清晰披露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务</td>\n<td>美国 IRS 1099-NEC 申报门槛 600 美元；加密/积分奖励适用 Notice 2014-21</td>\n<td>现金与可兑换权益构成税务事件，需判定预扣义务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>分销层级</strong>是中国市场最容易翻车的一条：很多「老带新」活动为冲裂变会自然设计成「你拉 A，A 拉 B，你还能从 B 的订单里分一杯羹」——这已逼近多层级计酬。安全的设计是把奖励严格限定在<strong>直接推荐的一层</strong>，且必须挂钩被邀请人的真实交易。2024-09-01 施行的《网络反不正当竞争暂行规定》进一步收紧了对刷量、虚假交易型增长的约束——反作弊设计不只是省钱手段，也是合规义务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>双边奖励买的是「被邀请人做过某一步」，不是曝光</strong>；两边都付钱的唯一理由是让被邀请人在转化那一刻就有理由留下。双边也不等于等额——付多少取决于哪一方的边际成本更高，成熟计划普遍收窄为「邀请人固定小额 + 被邀请人首单折扣」。</li>\n<li><strong>资格模型是风险与转化的对撞线</strong>：从「注册」推到「首单」作弊成本上升一个数量级，推到「过退货期」再上一个台阶。用增量口径衡量价值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GM</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>GM</mtext><mtext>paid</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>CAC</mtext><mtext>paid</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GM} - C &gt; \\text{GM}_{\\text{paid}} - \\text{CAC}_{\\text{paid}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CAC</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），否则你只是在给有机用户发钱。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K = i \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 决定自繁殖能力，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^{1/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才决定放大速度——缩短病毒周期往往比抬高奖励面值更划算。</li>\n<li>跨境落地要过四道关：广告披露（FTC）、平台政策（Apple/Google）、分销层级（中国《禁止传销条例》与《网络反不正当竞争暂行规定》）、税务（IRS 1099）。二级收益是红线区，奖励严格挂钩直接推荐的一层与真实交易是最稳的边界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"双边奖励与获客资格模型","id":"双边奖励与获客资格模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：双边奖励在优化什么","id":"核心概念-双边奖励在优化什么"},{"level":2,"text":"奖励结构的四个旋钮","id":"奖励结构的四个旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"资格模型：谁算「一次有效获客」","id":"资格模型-谁算-一次有效获客"},{"level":2,"text":"单位经济：K 因子、病毒周期与投放替代","id":"单位经济-k-因子-病毒周期与投放替代"},{"level":2,"text":"合规与平台边界（2026）","id":"合规与平台边界-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"推荐激励经济学与增量测算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-program-model-incentive-design/referral-incentive-economics-incrementality"}}